// GY-BMP280-3.3. Seated frame: z = 0 is the header plastic's underside, so the board's
// underside is at z = 2.54 and its top at z = 4.14. Outline 15.0 x 11.5 mm and 2.54 mm pin
// pitch are from https://domoticx.net/docs/bmp280-information/ (whose size photo labels the
// board 15.5 x 12 mm). PCB thickness (1.6 mm), mounting-hole size and centres, and on-board
// part positions are not dimensioned in either source and follow the module photos there and
// at https://startingelectronics.org/pinout/GY-BMP280-pressure-sensor-module/ .
// Pin order and the four 10 kΩ resistors are from those two sources: SCL, SDA and CSB pull up
// to VCC, and SDO pulls down to GND, so the I2C address is 0x76 unless SDO is tied high. The
// module has no regulator and no level shifter: VCC is the BMP280's VDD and VDDIO, 1.71 V to
// 3.6 V, and the pull-ups hold SDA and SCL at VCC. The two supply capacitors are 100 nF, the
// value Bosch recommends for C1 and C2; the module diagram shows two capacitors and does not
// print the value.
